<title>UK: Argentina sets 500 mln mark 30-year bond, +497 bp.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 500 mln mark 30-year bond, +497 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     11.75     MATURITY    13.NOV.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.25	REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+497 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.75	SELL CONC  1.00	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 2024 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
